And I try my best, might not be the best solution, but it is something.

1158
01:15:48,000 --> 01:15:51,320
I hope it helps and I hope it helps others as well, who are listening.

1159
01:15:51,400 --> 01:15:59,440
And it's a very sad situation to be in where you have to like literally write an email to an absolute stranger and share your vulnerability.

1160
01:15:59,520 --> 01:16:05,400
So thank you so much to whoever has written so far. I wish.

1161
01:16:05,480 --> 01:16:10,729
Wish I could help you, all of you, in a very personal manner as I can,

1162
01:16:10,809 --> 01:16:13,480
but this is the best I can do for now.

1163
01:16:13,560 --> 01:16:18,960
Take care and I hope you guys had a wonderful Eid. Enjoy the weekend and inshaAllah I'll talk to you again.

